  "_doc": "Tier-1 roadside diner on Route 9 (Pell's Crossing, lot 'diner', front faces the highway). Route: front doors blocked from inside -> in over a booth through the smashed window -> booths and counter (sleepers sit) -> round the torn-down end of the counter barricade (a bear trap set in the gap) -> swinging doors into the kitchen (the cook) -> open the walk-in pantry (two travellers wait inside: ambush) -> pantry (loot) -> slide the bolt on the delivery door and leave by the dumpsters. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
